      "challenges": [
        "1,971 alerts; 1,971 verified (100.0%), 347 validated suspects, 347 investigated (100.0%), and 218 transferred. Six provinces have numeric alert rows (Haut-Uele, Bas-Uele, Ituri, Nord-Kivu, Sud-Ubangi and Tshopo); Sud-Kivu is unavailable, not zero.",
        "Nord-Kivu prints 365 hospitalised patients, 223 of them in normed structures, and 63.0% occupancy without a bed count. 63.0% is 223/354 against the 354 beds SR135 last printed (the normed-structure basis); the all-patient basis would be 365/354 (103.1%). The normed count and rate are identical to SR135's 223 and 63.0%, which SR136 also reprinted, so the rate is withheld as a conflict. 142 patients (38.9%) are outside normed structures.",
