        "PoE/PoC completeness is 96/99 (97.0%). Of five PoE/PoC alerts, the Mabakese PoC (Mambasa) alert, a traveller from Musienene, was validated and transferred to the Mambasa CTE; both Karuruma PoC alerts in Nord-Kivu were invalidated.",
        "Ituri ring opening is 19/34 (55.9%), and 15 bodies were not swabbed for lack of supplies and teams at Mandima or after family refusals. Nord-Kivu household decontamination is 3/21 (14.3%).",
        "Two confirmed patients who left the Mangobo CTE (Tshopo) are still reported at home."
